      "description": "Direct visibility into the root cause of the 06-30 ephemeral-storage eviction incident: unbounded segment growth (segment.bytes/segment.ms too loose relative to retention) grows this without bound until kubelet evicts the pod at the ephemeral-storage limit. Should plateau, not climb indefinitely.",
